# Local per-run FTT time calibrations. StFttDbMaker prefers
# ./fttDataWindow/fttDataWindow.<run>.txt over the database, so anything run
# from a tree that has one silently ignores Calibrations/ftt/fttDataWindowsB.
# Keep it out of the repository: the calibrations that matter live in
# StRoot/StFttDbMaker/macro/FttDataWindows/data and in the database.
/fttDataWindow/

# ROOT's generated dictionaries for STL instantiations used in interpreted
# macros. ACLiC/CINT drops these in the CWD and regenerates them on demand.
AutoDict_*.cxx
AutoDict_*.h

# Python bytecode from the helper scripts in script/
__pycache__/

# Per-job input sublists for the FST overlap condor run. Regenerate with:
#   split -l 30 -d -a 3 --additional-suffix=.lis run24_mudst.txt \
#         condor/fwo_lists_<tag>/fwo_
# The submit file names them by absolute path, so they must exist at submit
# time, but they are a mechanical split of run24_mudst.txt and not content.
/condor/fwo_lists_*/

# Scratch at the top level: plots written straight into the tree by interpreted
# macros, geometry-cache builds and their logs, and compiler leftovers.
/*.png
/fGeom.*.root
/fGeom.*.log
/a.out

